docs/log/by_issue/
docs/log/analysis/

# Track summaries and audits (whitelist)
!docs/log/index.md
!docs/log/weekly_*.md
!docs/log/*/summary.md
!docs/log/failure_audit*.md
!docs/log/api_failures.md

